      "id": "k5kh42s",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4.1 State Government Structure"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The political structure of Gujarat comprises the Governor, the State Legislature, and the executive led by Chief Ministers.",
        "Local Self-Government in Gujarat is divided into Urban Local Bodies and Rural Local Bodies (Panchayati Raj).",
        "Governance in the state is reinforced by specific Constitutional Provisions and targeted State Government Schemes."
      ],
      "id": "o8k1nm9"
    },
