    },
    {
      "id": "z0arca0",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "Gujarat is scheduled in the Eighth Schedule as a recognized language of India (Gujarati language).",
        "Tribal populations in Gujarat (especially in Chhota Udaipur, Dahod, Narmada) are covered under 5th Schedule provisions for protection of tribal rights.",
        "PESA Act (Panchayati Raj Extension to Scheduled Areas): Applicable in tribal areas of Gujarat."
      ]
    },
